{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Combat-Integrated Visual Novel</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a tripartite world of Humans, the Divine Corpus Church, and Forsakers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two rustic youths\u2019 seemingly routine mission spirals into a crimson odyssey, unveiling a cannibalistic game rife with conspiracies and moral crossroads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative: </strong>Enjoy an exclusive &quot;Novel Mode&quot; with over 200,000 words and three intertwined storylines. Can you piece together the truth of the world by the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio-Visual: </strong>Continuing the team's signature cute and soothing art style, with over 200 plot CGs and timeless music that complements the story, providing a heartwarming reading experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat: </strong>Enjoy a lightly played, non-grinding card game that spices up your reading journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/7765bf8be1c61b0f79e2f68dfae3475c.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Epic Narrative: A Multilinear Mystery]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive Storytelling: 250,000+ words of meticulously crafted prose unveil the merciless survival laws of the continent of Hel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interwoven Perspectives: Employing a multi-POV narrative structure, each chapter advances through distinct protagonists' viewpoints. Initially fragmented storylines gradually converge into a mosaic of revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery of Blood and Threads: Truth lies scattered across perspectives like puzzle shards. Only by traversing every character's fate can players reconstruct the ultimate narrative closure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/e8ab9a769a399807ecc4cdbd4c3b10ca.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Sensory Pilgrimage]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Meticulously crafted stages breathe life into a hauntingly beautiful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Multiple CGs and Gothic-styled character portraits amplify the unique art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Melancholic melodies intertwine with storytelling for therapeutic immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/1031fbdd2feb55867d02f606788a4db9.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Barrier-Free Narrative]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Exclusive Novel Mode delivers seamless narrative consumption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Prioritized emotional design \u2013 witness every plot twist without interruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/8ee4a08c265e146c9425998ff5c74e67.avif?t=1758802533\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[A Combat-Integrated Visual Novel]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Card duels evolve organically with plot developments, forging a symbiotic story-mechanics relationship that deepens narrative immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. With narrative progression, players will encounter various characters and can recruit some of them as allies during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/303764a905edd4b4f6dd6740a5245ef2.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cast:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[The Scarlet Ghost of Loofah Village / The Unbroken Cripple]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/b3014e19403c538d60d8be0a93309e24.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our bargain-bin protagonist who nearly quit upon learning his &quot;resilient disabled&quot; character setting. Possesses peerless human combat skills... Yet in a world where opponents are anything but human. This indispensable lead actor's survival depends entirely on your guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[ Martyrdom Enthusiast / Lost Legion Commander]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/a0e33dade07cf7bbed705ea968af2508.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A runaway noblewoman whose red panda-esque appearance belies her iron will. Beneath her armored exterior lies unexpected vulnerability. Your strongest ally - unravel her burdens through thoughtful companionship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Wilderness Siren / Silent Bride]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/0b1d1b6187e8a34b344444452405a9c9.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silver-spooned starlet whose wooden acting was cleverly written as &quot;emotionless&quot;. Camera-perfect beauty masks seething hatred. Help this vengeance-driven maiden complete her bloody requiem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Dawn Champion / Surveillance Virtuoso]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/f9f8f9ea231d866e1f9f2bc95be3bed0.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prodigy trapped in the wrong script, yet pushing physiological limits daily. His noble ambition lies within grasp\u2014aid him at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stage Crew Member\uff1a</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Staff\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production Team\uff1aSword Lantern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Producer\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script/Direction\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u4e39\u54e5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copywriting\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy Editing/Configuration/Production Assistance\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u4e39\u54e5\u3001\u5446\u5446\u3001\u5927\u4e49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting Assistance\uff1a\u5927\u4e49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scene Concept Art\uff1a\u5c0fY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Concept Art\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5c0fY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG Concept Art\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5c0fY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5c0fY\u3001\u5927\u4e49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV/Marketing Art\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5c0fY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Design\uff1a\u5446\u5446</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming\uff1a\u82cf\u6469</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logisics\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5446\u5446\u3001\u5c0fY\u3001\u82cf\u6469\u3001\u5927\u4e49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >External Assistance (We thank them deeply)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Direction\uff1a\u8001\u90ed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music\uff1a\u91cd\u8fdc\u3001\u559c\u78a7\u3001\u5ce5\u5ce5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Effects\uff1a\u4e4c\u8292</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animation\uff1a\u5c0f\u4e91\u3001\u5c0f\u96c4\u3001\u67cf\u4e91</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Assistance\uff1a\u5c0f\u5ddd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Administrative Support\uff1a\u6731\u59d0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-production Assistance\uff1a\u5434\u8001\u5e08</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;We are deeply grateful for your support. This time, we simply wish to tell a good story.&quot;</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u2014 Sword Lantern</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Glowbugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/43427116adf99282182456fac81ba8c35f58df7c.jpg"},{"name":"Ant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/6998c38408a2e0cbdb1707b382105878c2356b50.jpg"},{"name":"HolyBlade Rebirth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/3c8e7a82006757d8ece23723f96f7e1f371c3908.jpg"},{"name":"Nirvana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/89d65c908dde6a0f6d5014ca6ac5f62ded5bd5dc.jpg"},{"name":"\u200bThe Decisive One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/69568c6607ccefdbef7f1b41cef98d450a36bf6d.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Versatility\u200b\u200b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/b5715954515d39a9f1e1344f518a349042be6684.jpg"},{"name":"Light of Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/6fcd2b871204ee76d84ee277e5f81d2568bf5382.jpg"},{"name":"Overpowering Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/8ba9787c639e9455580795e31e5e897cc3afae10.jpg"},{"name":"Self-Reliance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/538329adfef3fad612dfd6501fe4aa039da84114.jpg"},{"name":"Save and Steady","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3433940/22bd6701e0a7783df163eee982b3882d512be056.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433940?t=1758802533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433940?t=1758802533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/56121b83f0e6064c7864b37743e03d7cf88713ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758802533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/56121b83f0e6064c7864b37743e03d7cf88713ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758802533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"The game contains adult themes, including descriptions of bloody/violent plots and some female nudity."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Combat-Integrated Visual Novel</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a tripartite world of Humans, the Divine Corpus Church, and Forsakers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two rustic youths\u2019 seemingly routine mission spirals into a crimson odyssey, unveiling a cannibalistic game rife with conspiracies and moral crossroads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative: </strong>Enjoy an exclusive &quot;Novel Mode&quot; with over 200,000 words and three intertwined storylines. Can you piece together the truth of the world by the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio-Visual: </strong>Continuing the team's signature cute and soothing art style, with over 200 plot CGs and timeless music that complements the story, providing a heartwarming reading experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat: </strong>Enjoy a lightly played, non-grinding card game that spices up your reading journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/7765bf8be1c61b0f79e2f68dfae3475c.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Epic Narrative: A Multilinear Mystery]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive Storytelling: 250,000+ words of meticulously crafted prose unveil the merciless survival laws of the continent of Hel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interwoven Perspectives: Employing a multi-POV narrative structure, each chapter advances through distinct protagonists' viewpoints. Initially fragmented storylines gradually converge into a mosaic of revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery of Blood and Threads: Truth lies scattered across perspectives like puzzle shards. Only by traversing every character's fate can players reconstruct the ultimate narrative closure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/e8ab9a769a399807ecc4cdbd4c3b10ca.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Sensory Pilgrimage]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Meticulously crafted stages breathe life into a hauntingly beautiful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Multiple CGs and Gothic-styled character portraits amplify the unique art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Melancholic melodies intertwine with storytelling for therapeutic immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/1031fbdd2feb55867d02f606788a4db9.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Barrier-Free Narrative]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Exclusive Novel Mode delivers seamless narrative consumption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Prioritized emotional design \u2013 witness every plot twist without interruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/8ee4a08c265e146c9425998ff5c74e67.avif?t=1758802533\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[A Combat-Integrated Visual Novel]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Card duels evolve organically with plot developments, forging a symbiotic story-mechanics relationship that deepens narrative immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. With narrative progression, players will encounter various characters and can recruit some of them as allies during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/303764a905edd4b4f6dd6740a5245ef2.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cast:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[The Scarlet Ghost of Loofah Village / The Unbroken Cripple]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/b3014e19403c538d60d8be0a93309e24.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our bargain-bin protagonist who nearly quit upon learning his &quot;resilient disabled&quot; character setting. Possesses peerless human combat skills... Yet in a world where opponents are anything but human. This indispensable lead actor's survival depends entirely on your guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[ Martyrdom Enthusiast / Lost Legion Commander]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/a0e33dade07cf7bbed705ea968af2508.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A runaway noblewoman whose red panda-esque appearance belies her iron will. Beneath her armored exterior lies unexpected vulnerability. Your strongest ally - unravel her burdens through thoughtful companionship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Wilderness Siren / Silent Bride]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/0b1d1b6187e8a34b344444452405a9c9.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silver-spooned starlet whose wooden acting was cleverly written as &quot;emotionless&quot;. Camera-perfect beauty masks seething hatred. Help this vengeance-driven maiden complete her bloody requiem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Dawn Champion / Surveillance Virtuoso]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433940/extras/f9f8f9ea231d866e1f9f2bc95be3bed0.avif?t=1758802533\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prodigy trapped in the wrong script, yet pushing physiological limits daily. His noble ambition lies within grasp\u2014aid him at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stage Crew Member\uff1a</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Staff\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production Team\uff1aSword Lantern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Producer\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script/Direction\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u4e39\u54e5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copywriting\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy Editing/Configuration/Production Assistance\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u4e39\u54e5\u3001\u5446\u5446\u3001\u5927\u4e49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setting Assistance\uff1a\u5927\u4e49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scene Concept Art\uff1a\u5c0fY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Concept Art\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5c0fY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG Concept Art\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5c0fY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5c0fY\u3001\u5927\u4e49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV/Marketing Art\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5c0fY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Design\uff1a\u5446\u5446</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programming\uff1a\u82cf\u6469</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logisics\uff1a\u519c\u592b\u5361\u5361\u841d\u3001\u5446\u5446\u3001\u5c0fY\u3001\u82cf\u6469\u3001\u5927\u4e49</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >External Assistance (We thank them deeply)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Direction\uff1a\u8001\u90ed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music\uff1a\u91cd\u8fdc\u3001\u559c\u78a7\u3001\u5ce5\u5ce5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Effects\uff1a\u4e4c\u8292</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animation\uff1a\u5c0f\u4e91\u3001\u5c0f\u96c4\u3001\u67cf\u4e91</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Assistance\uff1a\u5c0f\u5ddd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Administrative Support\uff1a\u6731\u59d0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-production Assistance\uff1a\u5434\u8001\u5e08</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;We are deeply grateful for your support